### 3. Storage

| Product | Reads | Writes | Use case | Plans |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Vercel Blob** | milliseconds | milliseconds | files, images, video, user uploads - public or private stores | Hobby, Pro |
| **Global Config** | ultra-fast (99% under 10ms) | seconds | runtime configuration, feature flags; replicated to all CDN regions | Hobby, Pro, Enterprise |
